MintCurveConvexPositionFactory::initialize(address,address,MintCurveConvexConfig)
├── when admin is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryZeroAddress
├── when _marketRegistry is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryZeroAddress
├── when curvePool is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when convexBooster is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when convexRewardPool is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when crv is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when cvx is zero address
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when curve pool N_COINS is not 2
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when reward pool pid does not match convexPid
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when the booster poolInfo LP token does not match curvePool
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when the booster poolInfo reward pool does not match convexRewardPool
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
├── when the booster poolInfo reports the pool as shut down
│   └── it should revert with MintCurveConvexPositionFactoryInvalidConfig
└── when admin, _marketRegistry and config are valid
    ├── it should set marketRegistry
    ├── it should emit MarketRegistrySet
    ├── it should set config
    ├── it should emit MintCurveConvexConfigSet
    ├── it should set owner to admin
    └── it should not allow re-initialization
